// # CFI Mode, Violation & Hardware Feature Constants
//
// Logline: Provide CFI enforcement mode tags, violation tags, and hardware feature tags.
//
// Setup: RULES.oot 1.4 default-deny; RULES.oot 1.3 fail-closed residual.
//
// Beats:
//   1. cfi_mode_*: return disabled/coarse/fine/shadow/full tags.
//   2. cfi_violation_*: return violation tags.
//   3. cfi_feature_*: return hardware feature tags.
//   4. cfi_default_mode: return CFI mode tag for default policy.
//
// residual: constants only; live CFI driver is process_exit.

// RULES.oot 1.4: Default-deny for privileged effects. Explicit &SysCap required.
// RULES.oot 1.3: Fail-closed residual for unimplemented builtins.

// Destub: dropped import of cfi_types.oo (pub type emit gcc: type(long long struct)).

